lready start making preparations for my wedding. I plan a destination wedding but still have no idea about the wedding venue. Anyone has some great ideas? I also would like to know your budget and wedding theme! xx~&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911247,"PostDate":1456280644,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi everybody! I'm a 2017 bride, but I already start making preparations for my wedding. I plan a destination wedding but still have no idea about the wedding venue. Anyone has some great ideas? I also would like to know your budget and wedding theme! xx~<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sherry_xlx@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"121.127.226.122","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1455687847,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"GloriaEvans","Id":286249,"Name":"GloriaEvans","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.68.137.204","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79955,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94a0a3d72910f6f1548714ebf27d4705","RawContent":"Heyy!! Good luck. My theme.is coral and gold in a private villa. About my budget.....still worki g on it. I only have my budget for flowers and the venue itself. Looking for a caterer!! And music....\n\n\nEnviado desde mi SM-N910C mediante Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1911506,"PostDate":1456908211,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Heyy!! Good luck. My theme.is coral and gold in a private villa. About my budget.....still worki g on it. I only have my budget for flowers and the venue itself. Looking for a caterer!! And music....<br><br>\nEnviado desde mi SM-N910C mediante Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>ADRIANNE\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>WEDDING DATE JUNE 16 2016 \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>VILLA ALBATROZ CANCUN","Email":"eadrianne1990@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.147.233.0","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1455572687,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-286231.jpg?_r=1455591065","PhotoWidth":199,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Eadrianne1990","Id":286231,"Name":"Eadrianne1990","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.186.105.63","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79955,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"35d8d80dd8cd9641fe38538467f72810","RawContent":"Puerto Plata Dominican  at Lifestyle Holiday Resorts","Attachments":[],"Id":1911600,"PostDate":1457187054,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Puerto Plata Dominican  at Lifestyle Holiday Resorts\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candance01@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"50.11.52.41","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1440934462,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284619.jpg?_r=1440956169","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CandanceWilliams2be","Id":284619,"Name":"CandanceWilliams2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.184.57","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79955,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30c532f761d9372003fc92834d760335","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;What are you looking for in a wedding venue? Do you want something that has a nice beach? Do you want to have an all inclusive resort? What country\/region do you want?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Making a list of what you want and don&#039;t want helps. &amp;nbsp;I had a list and then did my research and also went and did site-inspections\/ youtube video tours in the Riviera Maya area in Mexico which helped me figure out where to book my wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911695,"PostDate":1457546850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>What are you looking for in a wedding venue? Do you want something that has a nice beach? Do you want to have an all inclusive resort? What country\/region do you want?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Making a list of what you want and don't want helps. \u00a0I had a list and then did my research and also went and did site-inspections\/ youtube video tours in the Riviera Maya area in Mexico which helped me figure out where to book my wedding.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"falleneight@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.26.14.237","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1441716631,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-284728.jpg?_r=1448387511","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"OttawaBride2017","Id":284728,"Name":"OttawaBride2017","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.157.81.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79955,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8dffd4b175b22b0c036e04a5b200872e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hello&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married in October 2016. &amp;nbsp;We chose to have it at the Royalton Punta Cana, DR. &amp;nbsp;Our budget is $12000.00&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope that helps!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1911944,"PostDate":1458065928,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hello\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married in October 2016. \u00a0We chose to have it at the Royalton Punta Cana, DR. \u00a0Our budget is $12000.00<\/p>\n<p>Hope that helps!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nsramsingh@gmail.com","IpAddress":"174.114.203.239","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454193522,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Natasha28","Id":286090,"Name":"Natasha28","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.221.32.119","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79955,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"08cffc1294de2673941e22e153648790","RawContent":"[quote name=\"GloriaEvans\" post=\"1911247\" timestamp=\"1456295044\"]\nHi everybody! I&#039;m a 2017 bride, but I already start making preparations for my wedding. I plan a destination wedding but still have no idea about the wedding venue. Anyone has some great ideas? I also would like to know your budget and wedding theme! xx~[\/quote]@[member=\"GloriaEvans\"] congrats on choosing a Destination Wedding,\n\nHave you watched this video, hope its helpful \n[url=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=pdiucnH2H7M\"]https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=pdiucnH2H7M[\/url]\n\nHappy Planning!\nJoyce","Attachments":[],"Id":1912157,"PostDate":1458779272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>GloriaEvans, on 24 February 2016 - 02:24 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi everybody! I'm a 2017 bride, but I already start making preparations for my wedding. I plan a destination wedding but still have no idea about the wedding venue. Anyone has some great ideas? I also would like to know your budget and wedding theme! xx~<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286249\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286249-gloriaevans\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GloriaEvans<\/span><\/a> congrats on choosing a Destination Wedding,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Have you watched this video, hope its helpful\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><iframe id=\"ytplayer\" class=\"EmbeddedVideo\" type=\"text\/html\" width=\"640\" height=\"390\" src=\"http:\/\/youtube.com\/embed\/pdiucnH2H7M?html5=1&fs=1\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen webkitallowfullscreen \/><\/iframe><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\n<p>Joyce<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326839987,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.35.43.137","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79955,"EditedBy":"<strong>Edited by Mangosong, 15 May 2016 - 06:49 PM.<\/strong>","EditDate":1463338150,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cf4723becdccf262ee4bbc90963504cf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"GloriaEvans\"] Westin Playa Conchal in Costa Rica.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We knew we wanted an all inclusive. So that played a key roll. We looked into Mexico and DR but ultimately decided against it for a number of reasons. A lot of our friends were actually super excited about CR because most of them have never been there before.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1913744,"PostDate":1463337900,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286249\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286249-gloriaevans\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GloriaEvans<\/span><\/a> Westin Playa Conchal in Costa Rica.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We knew we wanted an all inclusive. So that played a key roll. We looked into Mexico and DR but ultimately decided against it for a number of reasons. A lot of our friends were actually super excited about CR because most of them have never been there before.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407859786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.254.146.231","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79955,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"972c3fd59c4f80eadb911337de97de2c","RawContent":"@&lt;span&gt;GloriaEvans&lt;\/span&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;Congratulations on your engagement!! This is a great moment to be looking for your location for the big day in 2017. We are a secluted beach location at the south bay of Puerto Vallarta, known for creating great wedding experiences on a unique place that combines the beautiful clearwater sea and lots of vegetation from the Sierra Madre mountains; all in a romantic candle light setting. We invite you take a look at our beatuiful location: Las Caletas and our available wedding packages at the following address:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;. &lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83155]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83034]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82929]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914040,"PostDate":1464307094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                \n\t@<span>GloriaEvans<\/span>\n<p><span>Congratulations on your engagement!! This is a great moment to be looking for your location for the big day in 2017. We are a secluted beach location at the south bay of Puerto Vallarta, known for creating great wedding experiences on a unique place that combines the beautiful clearwater sea and lots of vegetation from the Sierra Madre mountains; all in a romantic candle light setting. We invite you take a look at our beatuiful location: Las Caletas and our available wedding packages at the following address:\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.adventure...gsvallarta.com\/<\/a>. <\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83155-lb-by-adventure-weddings\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18167\/sml_gallery_258213_18167_558235.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='L&B By Adventure weddings'  width='200' height='132'  alt='L&B By Adventure weddings' id='sml_image_view_83155' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83034-ceremony-at-paradise\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_2597851.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='ceremony at paradise'  width='200' height='134'  alt='ceremony at paradise' id='sml_image_view_83034' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/82929-pink-sunset-at-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18100\/sml_gallery_258213_18100_100921.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='pink sunset at las caletas'  width='200' height='85'  alt='pink sunset at las caletas' id='sml_image_view_82929' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343044403,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpg?_r=1475871220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.127.211.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79955,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2d1206c3db0b1e51cbbd5ebbd1b67d0c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"GloriaEvans\"] Forgot to add, while our budget is $20,000 we are aiming for $10,000, so I figure we&#039;ll be around $15,000. Our theme is vintage music.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1914160,"PostDate":1464897918,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286249\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286249-gloriaevans\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">GloriaEvans<\/span><\/a> Forgot to add, while our budget is $20,000 we are aiming for $10,000, so I figure we'll be around $15,000. Our theme is vintage music.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wonderlandgrl3@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"75.99.50.82","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1407859786,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279411.jpg?_r=1408152053","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mangosong","Id":279411,"Name":"Mangosong","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.231.40.58","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79955,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55252bd26dec71e05f5b42ff250cf7d9","RawContent":"We&#039;re getting married at Hyatt Ziva in Montego Bay, Jamaica. Originally our theme was going to be travel but I have since decided not to have a theme, I figure being in Jamaica in general is good enough. Budget is $15,000.","Attachments":[],"Id":1914199,"PostDate":1465161445,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We're getting married at Hyatt Ziva in Montego Bay, Jamaica. Originally our theme was going to be travel but I have since decided not to have a theme, I figure being in Jamaica in general is good enough. Budget is $15,000.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"townsendsmithwed@gmail.com","IpAddress":"173.66.3.166","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427028004,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282503.jpeg?_r=1462490971","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":199,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tiffanyt","Id":282503,"Name":"tiffanyt","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79955","Title":"What Is Your Destination Venue?","LastPostDate":1476614921},"Pages":{"TotalItems":13,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
